IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SMOOTHQUANT-ULTRA.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ALPHA-PCT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SQ-ULTRA.
    IF HIDDEN-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 49 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 28 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 HIDDEN-DIM.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
